<item><title>Amnesty urges war-crimes inquiry into RSF drone strikes in El Obeid</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/amnesty-urges-war-crimes-inquiry-into-rsf-drone-strikes-in-4325a1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/amnesty-urges-war-crimes-inquiry-into-rsf-drone-strikes-in-4325a1/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The rights group says nine attacks killed 37 civilians and injured 10 between June and August 2026, hitting homes and civilian infrastructure.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:05:56 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Drone strikes drive most civilian deaths in Sudan, UN rights office finds</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/drone-strikes-drive-most-civilian-deaths-in-sudan-un-rights-f81f14/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/drone-strikes-drive-most-civilian-deaths-in-sudan-un-rights-f81f14/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The UN Human Rights Office counted more than 2,230 civilians killed in Sudan from January to October, with over 1,630 of those deaths caused by drones.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:10:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>White Nile sets diesel at SDG 69,842.50 a gallon as farmers report shortages</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/white-nile-sets-diesel-at-sdg-69-842-50-a-gallon-as-farmers-fed044/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/white-nile-sets-diesel-at-sdg-69-842-50-a-gallon-as-farmers-fed044/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The state also priced petrol at SDG 53,365 a gallon, while farmers say scarce diesel is disrupting irrigation in Um Rimta.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:05:25 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/white-nile-sets-diesel-at-sdg-69-842-50-a-gallon-as-farmers-fed044/share.jpg" length="47192" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/white-nile-sets-diesel-at-sdg-69-842-50-a-gallon-as-farmers-fed044/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>GERD operations leave Sudan’s Roseires dam exposed to sudden flow changes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/gerd-operations-leave-sudan-s-roseires-dam-exposed-to-6b08ea/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/gerd-operations-leave-sudan-s-roseires-dam-exposed-to-6b08ea/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>A study says releases from Ethiopia’s newly opened dam can alter levels at Sudan’s irrigation hub within hours, affecting water supplies and farms.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:59:40 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
